  "steps": [
    "Slice one onion.",
    "Add cooking oil to a pan and fry the sliced onion shortly.",
    "Add 1/2 tablespoon chilli pepper powder, 1/2 tablespoon sugar, and 2 tablespoons soy sauce.",
    "Fry for about 1 minute to keep the texture without making the onion too soft, then turn off the heat.",
    "Add 1 tablespoon sesame oil and black pepper powder, then mix evenly.",
    "Place cooked rice into a bowl and top with the cooked seasoned onion.",
    "Top with a fried egg and optionally garnish with sesame seeds."
